{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c62632f-856b-8e25-8b4a-2a0e7b2662d5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:50:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Susan Lawton. I am calling about a water and sewer bill, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, Ms. Lawton. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I just bought the house, and the first bill came in the name of the former owner. It is not my name on it. I want to be sure it is correct and that it comes to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That happens after a sale, the account can lag behind the deed. Is the closing date recent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we closed three weeks ago. The bill has a very high amount for usage. I think this is because of the toilet. It was running constantly last month, before we moved in. We had it repaired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the high usage may be a leak from that toilet. Do you have the account number from the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one moment. [pause] I have it. It is four, four, one, seven, zero, dash, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. And the name on it is the previous owner, right? I'm showing the account still under that name, with a read from mid-November."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. So the charge is for a period when I was not owner. And the amount is wrong for me, I think. I would like a supervisor to review the charge, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. I can't adjust it from my desk, so a supervisor will need to look at the meter reads and the sale date. I can put in a request for review and also ask that the account be moved into your name. Can you give me the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five. Good. Do you have a copy of the closing statement or anything showing the date of transfer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the papers. My grandson will bring them, but he has gym class today and he always forgets sneakers, so he is running late with everything. I can bring documents this afternoon, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. You can bring them to the utilities window, or send a copy. Just have the account number on the first page. The supervisor should call you within a few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few business days. Thank you. And the bill, I should not pay it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd hold off until the review is done. I'll note the account that a dispute is open so nothing goes forward in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you very much, Miss Priya. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T10:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Lawton. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
